    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Unearth Forbidden Lore of Ineffable Beings</p></blockquote><p>When you choose this subclass, you might bind yourself to an unspeakable being from the Far Realm or to an elder god—such as Tharizdun, the Chained God; Zargon, the Returner; Hadar, the Dark Hunger; or Great Cthulhu. Or you might invoke several entities without yoking yourself to any one. The motives of these beings are incomprehensible, and the Great Old One might be indifferent to your existence, but the secrets you've learned let you draw strange magic from it nonetheless.</p><h3>Great Old One Patron Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.IVbuELdtq9gDX75Y]{Awakened Mind}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.v5D6p1GinnWHDljQ]{Great Old One Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.TcvWPHDmCbEZcFvA]{Psychic Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Fzed3w3IPTwPO2tZ]{Clairvoyant Combatant}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Njh9OFmRMoylxa7C]{Eldritch Hex}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.GodRnvxMB9aYwWyG]{Thought Shield}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.W3R4VcEnO1GnN9yp]{Create Thrall}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Great Old One Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Warlock Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectThou]{Detect Thoughts}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDissonantW]{Dissonant Whispers}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbPhantasmalFor]{Phantasmal Force}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTashasHide]{Tasha's Hideous Laughter}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplClairvoyan]{Clairvoyance}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.azhfcdy96idtT6uT]{Hunger of Hadar}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConfusion0]{Confusion}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.aN1q4UJrbMIsxUmQ]{Summon Aberration}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplModifyMemo]{Modify Memory}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTelekinesi]{Telekinesis}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
